.TH "CPS-PUBLISH-BUNDLE" 1 "" "CPS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
\&cps\-publish\-bundle \- \&Publish a reproducible build bundle after verifying its worker signature and reviewed recipe
.SH SYNOPSIS
.HP 4
.B \&cps publish\-bundle [OPTIONS] \-\-repo <REPO> \-\-signing\-key <KEY> \-\-builder\-key <BUILDER_KEY> \-\-recipe\-sha256 <RECIPE_SHA256> <BUNDLE>
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.B \&<BUNDLE>
\&Build bundle from cps build \-\-builder\-signing\-key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \&\-\-repo <REPO>
\&Local repository to publish into
.TP
.B \&\-\-signing\-key <KEY>
\&Catalog key: PATH, file:PATH, or command:DESCRIPTOR (repeat to meet the catalog threshold)
.TP
.B \&\-\-builder\-key <BUILDER_KEY>
\&Public key of the build worker that signed the bundle's attestation
.TP
.B \&\-\-recipe\-sha256 <RECIPE_SHA256>
\&SHA\-256 of the reviewed build recipe
.TP
.B \&\-\-witness <KEY=ATTESTATION>
\&Another worker's public key and its attestation for the same build
.TP
.B \&\-\-source\-cache <SOURCE_CACHE>
\&Cache of verified source files to include in the publication
.TP
.B \&\-h, \-\-help
\&Print help
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cps (1)
